:name: ThreadX + SystemView over emulated J-Link RTT
:description: Runs the txsv demo; renode/sv_rtt_probe.py reads SystemView's RTT buffer like a J-Link and serves SystemView's IP Recorder on 127.0.0.1:19111.

$elf?=@build-renode/demo
$port?=19111

mach create "threadx-sv"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/threadx_m4.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset

# Probe stand-in: reads/writes _SEGGER_RTT over the system bus from a host
# thread, like J-Link over SWD. Firmware needs no transport code.
include @renode/sv_rtt_probe.py
sv_rtt_probe $port

start
